            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Markdown is intended to be as easy-to-read and easy-to-write as is feasible.",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "text": "Readability, however, is emphasized above all else. A Markdown-formatted",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "document should be publishable as-is, as plain text, without looking",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "like it's been marked up with tags or formatting instructions. While",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "Markdown's syntax has been influenced by several existing text-to-HTML",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "filters -- including ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "Setext",
              "style": "Plain",
              "url": "http://docutils.sourceforge.net/mirror/setext.html"
            },
            {
              "text": ", ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "atx",
              "style": "Plain",
              "url": "http://www.aaronsw.com/2002/atx/"
            },
            {
              "text": ", ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "Textile",
              "style": "Plain",
              "url": "http://textism.com/tools/textile/"
            },
            {
              "text": ", ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "reStructuredText",
              "style": "Plain",
              "url": "http://docutils.sourceforge.net/rst.html"
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "Grutatext",
              "style": "Plain",
              "url": "http://www.triptico.com/software/grutatxt.html"
            },
            {
              "text": ", and ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "EtText",
              "style": "Plain",
              "url": "http://ettext.taint.org/doc/"
            },
            {
              "text": " -- the single biggest source of",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": " ",
              "style": "Plain"
            },
            {
              "text": "inspiration for Markdown's syntax is the format of plain text email.",
              "style": "Plain"
            }
          ]
